  <summary>Retro-styled media player</summary>
  <description>
    <p>SlopAMP plays your own video and music files, YouTube links through YouTube's official embedded player, and
    X video posts. It has playlist tabs, an equalizer, a MilkDrop-style visualizer, skins, downloads with yt-dlp, and
    CLIP for cutting, converting and joining clips.</p>
